<!-- Manual-lookup shortcut mark (#89). Repo-authored, like the camera shortcut's
     ic_shortcut_camera: a magnifier over an open dictionary page, so it reads as
     "look a word up" beside the ordinary app entry.
     First-party, so it adds NO row to app/licenses/components.tsv — that index
     is the bundled THIRD-PARTY notice index. -->
